      "title": {
        "en": "Ciasne, ale własne"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Ciasne, ale własne* (cramped, but my own) is what Poles say of a small flat they love. To describe a flat: *wygodny* (comfortable), *cichy* (quiet), *jasny*, *z widokiem na park* (with a view of the park). Where in the room: *w rogu* (in the corner), *na środku* (in the middle), *obok* (next to): *obok biurka*."
      }
    }
  ],
